1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
Okay, I'll wait until you're ready.

2
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,700
Get back to drawing, Nawin.
Next month's rent won't pay itself.

3
00:00:12,533 --> 00:00:16,666
Don't come to my studio or check up on me.
When I want to see you, I'll reach out.

4
00:00:18,633 --> 00:00:19,600
Don't you dare think about him.

5
00:00:20,533 --> 00:00:21,766
Who am I kidding? I still do.

6
00:00:22,633 --> 00:00:24,900
Even so, I'm not going back.
I need to take care of myself first.

7
00:00:26,333 --> 00:00:29,266
The marriage and the project are waiting.
How much longer do you plan to stall?

8
00:00:30,233 --> 00:00:31,400
I won't agree to the marriage.

9
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,600
Who I love isn't a bargaining chip.

10
00:00:34,366 --> 00:00:36,466
Walk out that door, you lose the project.

11
00:00:36,533 --> 00:00:36,933
Think carefully.

12
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:43,300
Then replace me. I refuse this marriage.

13
00:00:44,366 --> 00:00:46,766
You think he'll come back
just because you gave up so much for him?

14
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:49,533
Whether he comes back or not,
I shouldn't force him anymore.

15
00:00:52,166 --> 00:00:56,366
Alright. I won't check up on you or visit.
Just focus on your art.

16
00:00:56,933 --> 00:01:02,833
Your parents' loan is now fully settled.
It's handled per contract. Not your issue.

17
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:06,433
Thanks. Don't contact me about this again.

18
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:09,800
Okay. I'll only contact your parents now.

19
00:01:11,833 --> 00:01:14,533
I'll hang up now.
I'm still waiting for the gallery's reply.

20
00:01:17,033 --> 00:01:21,266
Ah Tan, Coast Gallery is showing my art
next week. Do you... want to come?
